  Qwen/Qwen3-ForcedAligner-0.6B        Apache-2.0 (model weights, downloaded at install time)
  3D-Speaker CAM++ zh-en "advanced"    Voiceprint model of the meeting mode. Published by the 3D-Speaker project (Tongyi Lab) on ModelScope as
                                       iic/speech_campplus_sv_zh_en_16k-common_advanced; the license field of its ModelScope page
                                       reads "Apache License 2.0" (checked 2026-10-09; the page names no license file and does not
