                                       the model or have compliance requirements, confirm them yourself.

The full list of installed packages is pinned in constraints.txt (UI environment) and
requirements-asr.txt (speech-recognition environment). Review the license of each package
before redistributing a bundled copy of an installed environment.

The proofreading, the speaker fill and the translation send transcribed text to the OpenAI-compatible chat services you
configure; the models and services you choose are subject to their own terms. Voiceprints are kept in memory only and are
never written to a file.
